### Packaging Platform API Test Requests
### 用法：
### 1. 先确认后端已启动：ARTIFACT_STORE=local DRY_RUN=true go run ./cmd/server
### 2. 可先运行：python scripts/seed_cli.py seed
### 3. 本文件可在 JetBrains HTTP Client、VS Code REST Client 等工具中执行。
### 4. runner claim 会改变 queued 构建状态；执行前请确认不会误领真实任务。

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@productId = lsap
@seedNamespace = flow-validation

### 当前 seed_cli.py 生成的 flow-validation 构建 ID。
### 如果重新使用不同 namespace 生成数据，请先执行“列出构建”，再替换这些变量。
@pendingBuildId = 659687058f2b
@queuedBuildId = ead53f6a0abb
@succeededPreviewBuildId = 98b5402815f7
@releaseReadyBuildId = f3875e0cd74d
@releaseBlockedLatestBuildId = b362acd2e262
@windowsSucceededBuildId = 96e3fd95dc45
@failedBuildId = 43ef975ef9a3

@runnerId = http-seed-runner-01
@auditBuildId = {{releaseReadyBuildId}}
@oidcCode = replace-with-idp-code
@oidcCodeVerifier = replace-with-pkce-verifier
@oidcRedirectUri = http://localhost:5173/

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### OIDC Broker：用 Authorization Code + PKCE 换平台 session token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/oidc/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{oidcCode}}",
  "codeVerifier": "{{oidcCodeVerifier}}",
  "redirectUri": "{{oidcRedirectUri}}"
}

### Auth Logout：撤销 broker 持久化 session，静态 token/原始 OIDC token 为 no-op
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 产品列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### 产品详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}

### 产品 Manifest
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/manifest

### 产品版本
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/versions

### Profile 覆盖列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/overlays/profiles

### QA Profile 覆盖
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/overlays/profiles/qa

### 客户覆盖列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/overlays/customers

### example-customer 客户覆盖
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/overlays/customers/example-customer

### Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### 审计事件列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-events?buildId={{auditBuildId}}

### 审计归档导出：返回 digest；配置 AUDIT_ARCHIVE_HMAC_KEY 后还会返回 signature
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-events/archive?buildId={{auditBuildId}}

### Manifest Dry Run：固定版本，Release 可复现路径
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/manifest/dry-run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manifest": {
    "id": "lsap",
    "name": "智能定位平台",
    "targets": ["linux", "windows"],
    "targetConfig": {
      "linux": {
        "installDir": "/opt/lsap",
        "packageName": "lsap-linux-x86_64"
      },
      "windows": {
        "installDir": "C:\\Program Files\\LSAP",
        "packageName": "lsap-windows-x64-setup"
      }
    },
    "profiles": ["qa", "prod"],
    "versions": ["latest", "1.0.0"],
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "location-engine",
        "type": "docker-image",
        "required": true,
        "source": {
          "kind": "fixed-url",
          "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/seed-artifacts/location-engine-1.0.0.tar.gz"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ui",
        "type": "archive",
        "required": true,
        "source": {
          "kind": "fixed-url",
          "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/seed-artifacts/ui-1.0.0.zip"
        }
      }
    ],
    "workloads": [
      {
        "id": "location-engine",
        "runtime": "docker",
        "component": "location-engine",
        "docker": {
          "image": "location-engine:{{version}}",
          "containerName": "lsap-location-engine",
          "ports": ["{{ports.web}}:8080"],
          "restart": "unless-stopped"
        }
      }
    ],
    "config": {
      "ports": {
        "web": 48000
      },
      "customer": {
        "name": "Validation Customer",
        "license": "enterprise"
      },
      "modules": {
        "map": true
      }
    }
  },
  "target": "linux",
  "profile": "prod",
  "customer": "example-customer",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "releaseChannel": "preview",
  "configOverrides": {
    "installDir": "/opt/lsap-validation",
    "ports": {
      "web": 49100
    }
  },
  "componentOverrides": {},
  "variables": {
    "seedNamespace": "{{seedNamespace}}",
    "requestedBy": "docs/platform-api.http"
  }
}

### 上传列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/uploads

### 上传测试文件
### REST Client 支持 < ./path/to/file 的工具可直接使用；否则用管理后台或 seed_cli.py 上传。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/uploads
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----packaging-http-boundary

------packaging-http-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="http-client-validation.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

http client validation artifact
------packaging-http-boundary--

### 列出构建
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds

### 查看待审批 Preview 构建
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{pendingBuildId}}

### 查看排队 Linux 构建
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{queuedBuildId}}

### 查看已成功 Preview 构建
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{succeededPreviewBuildId}}

### 查看已验证且可发布 Release 的构建
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{releaseReadyBuildId}}

### 查看 latest 导致 Release 阻塞的构建
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{releaseBlockedLatestBuildId}}

### 查看 Windows 成功构建
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{windowsSucceededBuildId}}

### 查看失败可重试构建
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{failedBuildId}}

### 查看 Build Lock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{releaseReadyBuildId}}/lock

### 查看构建日志
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{releaseReadyBuildId}}/logs

### 查看发布门禁：Release Ready 应通过
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{releaseReadyBuildId}}/release-check

### 导出签名 Release 证据归档：包含 digest/signature/archiveUri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{releaseReadyBuildId}}/release-evidence/archive

### 查看发布门禁：latest 应阻塞 Release
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{releaseBlockedLatestBuildId}}/release-check

### 下载构建产物：有 downloadUrl 时会 302 跳转
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{releaseReadyBuildId}}/download

### 创建新的 Linux Preview 构建：pending_approval
### 注意：如果要重复运行，建议改 seedScenario 或 namespace。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/builds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "target": "linux",
  "profile": "qa",
  "customer": "example-customer",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "releaseChannel": "preview",
  "variables": {
    "seedNamespace": "{{seedNamespace}}",
    "seedScenario": "http-client-created-preview",
    "requestedBy": "docs/platform-api.http"
  },
  "configOverrides": {
    "installDir": "/opt/lsap-http-validation",
    "ports": {
      "web": 49200
    },
    "customer": {
      "name": "HTTP Validation Customer",
      "license": "enterprise"
    },
    "database": {
      "passwordPolicy": "strong"
    },
    "modules": {
      "camera": false,
      "push": true,
      "map": true
    }
  },
  "componentOverrides": {
    "location-engine": {
      "kind": "fixed-url",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/seed-artifacts/location-engine-1.0.0.tar.gz"
    },
    "location-guard": {
      "kind": "fixed-url",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/seed-artifacts/location-guard-1.0.0.tar.gz"
    },
    "location-push": {
      "kind": "fixed-url",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/seed-artifacts/location-push-1.0.0.tar.gz"
    },
    "ui": {
      "kind": "fixed-url",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/seed-artifacts/ui-1.0.0.zip"
    }
  }
}

### 审批待审批构建：会进入 queued
### 使用返回的新 build id 替换变量，或用当前 seed 的 pendingBuildId 测试。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{pendingBuildId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Runner Claim：会领取最早 queued 的 linux 构建，并改为 running
### 注意：这会改变队列状态。建议只在测试库或确认无真实 queued 构建时执行。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/runner/tasks/claim
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "runnerId": "{{runnerId}}",
  "target": "linux"
}

### Runner 写日志
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{queuedBuildId}}/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "{{runnerId}}",
  "message": "http client validation log"
}

### Runner 心跳
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/runner/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "runnerId": "{{runnerId}}",
  "buildId": "{{queuedBuildId}}",
  "target": "linux",
  "message": "http client heartbeat"
}

### Runner 完成任务：需要 build 当前是 running
### 如果直接使用 queuedBuildId 失败，先执行 Runner Claim，并把被 claim 的 id 填到这里。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/runner/tasks/{{queuedBuildId}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "succeeded",
  "artifactUri": "local-upload://http-client/lsap-linux-1.0.0.tar.gz",
  "downloadUrl": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/uploads/http-client/download"
}

### Preview 验证：succeeded preview 才能通过
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{succeededPreviewBuildId}}/validate-preview
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 发布 Release：releaseReadyBuildId 应通过并变为 published
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{releaseReadyBuildId}}/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 发布 Release：latest 阻塞示例，应返回 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{releaseBlockedLatestBuildId}}/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 重试失败构建：failed -> queued
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{failedBuildId}}/retry
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 取消 queued/running/pending 构建
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/builds/{{queuedBuildId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{}
